# Failure Loop Protocol

When evaluation fails:

1. Bug report becomes the new sprint input.
2. Append to `implementation/progress.md` "Failed Approaches" (max 10 lines).
3. Compact the rest of `implementation/progress.md`.
4. Generate new `planning/contract.md` scoped to failures.
5. Rubric weights may shift based on failure type.
6. Generator MUST read Failed Approaches before restarting.
